    This function will replace all spaces with "(" and ")" and pass it to parse_nested_parens.
    e.g. (()()) ((())) () ((())()()) -> ((()()) (((())) (()) ((()))))
    Then this function will replace all "(" with ")" and ")" with "(" and return the result to parse_nested_parens.
